  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Implementing the Ocean Decade Africa Roadmap</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The primary objective is to facilitate the implementation of key elements of the Ocean Decade Africa Roadmap, thereby increasing African engagement and leadership in the Ocean Decade. It will focus on three main pillars: fostering a conducive environment for the Africa Roadmap including further development of a framework Decade programme for sustainable ocean management in Africa, enhancing Marine Spatial Planning to contribute to the sustainable ocean management focus of the Decade in Africa, and promoting Ocean Literacy within the Ocean Decade&apos;s implementation in Africa to fulfil relevant priorities of the Roadmap.</narrative>
  </description>
